menu "Hubo E22 radio"
    config HUBO_E22_SX1262_COMPAT
        bool "Use the measured SX1262-compatible E22 profile"
        default n
        help
            Enable only for an E22-400M30S verified to report SX1261
            and pass the SX1262-compatible receive probe. The module
            band and chip power limits still apply. Disabled selects SX1268.

    config HUBO_E22_RXEN_GPIO
        int "GPIO wired to the E22 RXEN pin"
        default 2
        help
            The standard board wires RXEN to GPIO2. The GNSS board
            moves RXEN to GPIO0 and repurposes GPIO2 as GPS_EN_N.

    config HUBO_GPS_EN_N_GPIO
        int "GPIO wired to the active-low GNSS power switch (-1 = none)"
        default -1
        help
            GNSS board: GPIO2 = GPS_EN_N, low powers the GNSS. The pin is driven high at
            start-up (GNSS off); the GNSS driver powers it on when the "gps" custom variable is 1.
endmenu
